order <= 5: 281 matrices
right eigen-directions shared by >= 2 matrices (nonzero eigenvalue): {(2, 1, -1): [-1, 1]}
left eigen-functionals shared by >= 2 matrices (nonzero eigenvalue): {(2, -1, -1): [-1, 1]}
words over order <= 4 ( 61 matrices ), lengths 1-3, with |det| = 1, |tr|, |c2| <= 3: (length, tr, c2, det) -> count {(1, 1, -1, 1): 1, (1, 3, -1, 1): 1, (2, 3, -1, 1): 1}
char poly t^3 - tr t^2 + c2 t - det; (1,-1,1): t^3-t^2-t-1 (singleton, tribonacci); (3,-1,1): t^3-3t^2-t-1 (TT_2 source->sink); neither is unipotent
